iluting existing holders.","It pays out 444% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 58 employees, each generates about $13.4M of revenue, 5.9x the Real Estate median, and revenue has grown 17.2% a year across its filed history.","CEO pay is $3.5M (0x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $196K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":26,"head":"Avoid: priced 140% above its fair value of $8.51.","pros":["Returns 5.4% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Trades 140% above fair value of $8.51","ROIC 3.1% vs WACC 6.7%","Net debt/EBITDA 5.4x","Interest coverage only 2.4x","P/E 75.7x vs sector 23.9x"],"flags":["Priced 140% above its fair value of $8.51"],"need":[],"buy_below":7.24,"vc":{"base":8.51,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":8.51,"n_alt":3,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.1194,"level":"MEDIUM","why":[]},"med":{"pe":23.8785,"ev_ebitda":16.1705,"pfcf":17.849,"pb":1.3551,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.5564,"fcf_margin":0.1712,"div_yield":0.0475}},"ticker":"SBRA","date":"2026-11-13"}